      "created_at": "2013-03-13T05:54:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>From what I understand, it actually needs to take damage from the attack in order for the Reactive Plating Subroutine to take effect.&nbsp; I don't have a citation, but I remember that being a subject that was extensively discussed on the playtesting forum.</p>",
